1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:11,000
COMMAND • RADIO: Echo Actual, this is Command. Be advised, we've lost contact with Observation Post Seven. Last transmission was approximately forty minutes ago.

2
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:20,000
MASON: Command lost contact with Echo-Seven. Our job is to find out why.

3
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:25,000
JACKSON: Probably another broken radio.

4
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:32,000
MASON: Then we fix it and come home. Weapons tight unless threatened. Understood?

5
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:34,500
SQUAD: Roger.

6
00:00:59,000 --> 00:01:04,000
JACKSON: You think we're gonna see anything out here?

7
00:01:05,000 --> 00:01:08,000
HAYES: Hopefully not.

8
00:01:09,000 --> 00:01:13,000
JACKSON: Man, you guys are boring.

9
00:01:17,000 --> 00:01:25,000
COMMAND • RADIO: Echo One, be advised. Unconfirmed movement reported near the northern boundary. Exercise caution.

10
00:01:26,000 --> 00:01:29,000
MASON: Echo One copies.

11
00:01:30,000 --> 00:01:34,000
MASON: Pull over. We walk from here.

12
00:01:45,000 --> 00:01:51,000
MASON: Stay alert. Nobody gets separated.

13
00:02:02,000 --> 00:02:06,000
REED: Where is everybody?

14
00:02:07,000 --> 00:02:13,000
MASON: That's what we're here to find out.

15
00:02:28,000 --> 00:02:33,000
JACKSON: Sarge. You need to see this.

16
00:02:35,000 --> 00:02:39,000
MASON: Everybody, stay sharp.

17
00:02:41,000 --> 00:02:52,000
HAYES: Command, Echo One. We're at Echo-Seven. Position appears abandoned. Signs of a possible engagement.

18
00:02:53,000 --> 00:02:58,000
COMMAND • RADIO: Echo One, say again your last?

19
00:03:00,000 --> 00:03:04,000
REED: Sergeant... movement.

20
00:03:11,000 --> 00:03:15,000
MASON: Hold your fire.

21
00:03:26,000 --> 00:03:34,000
MASON: Unidentified patrol! You're inside Blue-controlled territory! Identify yourselves!

22
00:03:34,000 --> 00:03:42,000
RED LEADER: This territory is under Red military authority. Lower your weapons.

23
00:03:43,000 --> 00:03:49,000
MASON: Negative. We're not looking for a fight.

24
00:03:54,000 --> 00:03:58,000
MASON: CONTACT! GET DOWN!

25
00:04:18,000 --> 00:04:22,000
JACKSON: I GOT 'EM!

26
00:04:25,000 --> 00:04:30,000
MASON: Short bursts! Watch your ammunition!

27
00:04:37,000 --> 00:04:41,000
HAYES: AH! I'M HIT!

28
00:04:42,000 --> 00:04:44,000
REED: Hayes!

29
00:04:45,000 --> 00:04:50,000
REED: Stay with me. You're gonna be fine.

30
00:04:50,000 --> 00:04:55,000
HAYES: Radio... get the radio...

31
00:04:56,000 --> 00:05:05,000
RED LEADER: Red Two, this is Patrol Six! We're taking fire at Echo-Seven! Request immediate support!

32
00:05:05,000 --> 00:05:11,000
RED COMMAND: Patrol Six, disengage if possible. Reinforcements are moving.

33
00:05:11,000 --> 00:05:15,000
RED LEADER: We're not leaving him!

34
00:05:16,000 --> 00:05:21,000
JACKSON: They're pulling back! I can get 'em!

35
00:05:21,000 --> 00:05:25,000
MASON: Negative! Hold position!

36
00:05:26,000 --> 00:05:29,000
MASON: Reed, status?

37
00:05:29,000 --> 00:05:35,000
REED: Hayes is stable, but we need to get him out.

38
00:05:36,000 --> 00:05:48,000
MASON: Command, Echo One. Troops in contact. Multiple enemy combatants. One friendly wounded. Request immediate extraction and reinforcements.

39
00:05:54,000 --> 00:06:00,000
JACKSON: They just crossed the border and started shooting.

40
00:06:00,000 --> 00:06:05,000
MASON: We don't know who fired first.

41
00:06:07,000 --> 00:06:11,000
JACKSON: Does it matter?

42
00:06:16,000 --> 00:06:21,000
COMMAND • RADIO: Echo One, this is Command. We read you. What's your situation?

43
00:06:21,000 --> 00:06:27,000
MASON: Echo-Seven is compromised. Red troops crossed the boundary. We exchanged fire. Requesting immediate support.

44
00:06:28,000 --> 00:06:31,000
COMMAND • RADIO: Echo One... you need to leave that position. Now.

45
00:06:31,000 --> 00:06:32,000
MASON: Why?

46
00:06:32,000 --> 00:06:35,000
COMMAND • RADIO: We've detected multiple armored vehicles moving south toward your location.

47
00:06:42,000 --> 00:06:52,000
RED COMMANDER: All units, this is Red Actual. Phase One is underway. Begin the advance.
